          "Credit": {
            "value": "<p>Head drawing - Patrick J. Lynch, <a href=\"//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Head_anatomy_anterior_lateral_views.svg\" title=\"File:Head anatomy anterior lateral views.svg\">Head_anatomy_anterior_lateral_views.svg</a><br>\nLocation sinuses:\n</p>\n<ul><li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.csmc.edu/images/paranasal_sinus_web-80322.jpg\">CSMC (Cedars-Sinai Health System)</a></li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.csmc.edu/images/sinus_web-80302.jpg\">CSMC (Cedars-Sinai Health System)</a></li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external autonumber\" href=\"http://www.marin4kids.com/wp-content/uploads/2008/07/sinusite.jpg\">[1]</a></li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external autonumber\" href=\"http://www.aist.go.jp/aist_e/sst/exhibition_guide/images/photo31_2.jpg\">[2]</a></li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external autonumber\" href=\"http://cache.eb.com/eb/image?id=72225&amp;rendTypeId=35\">[3]</a></li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external autonumber\" href=\"http://www.nationalpainfoundation.org/dis_cond/Headache/ParanasalSinuses.jpg\">[4]</a></li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external autonumber\" href=\"http://a248.e.akamai.net/7/248/430/20080327144037/www.mercksource.com/ppdocs/us/common/dorlands/dorland/images/sinus_s.%20paranasales(1).jpg\">[5]</a></li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external autonumber\" href=\"http://www.medicalook.com/systems_images/paranasal_sinuses.gif\">[6]</a></li></ul>\n<table class=\"layouttemplate\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin:.5em auto;width:100%;background:var(--background-color-neutral-subtle,#f8f8f8);border:2px solid var(--border-color-muted,#EEE);color: inherit;padding:5px\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"padding:5px\"><div class=\"wpImageAnnotatorControl wpImageAnnotatorOff\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Applications-graphics.svg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/76/Applications-graphics.svg/60px-Applications-graphics.svg.png?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"45\" height=\"45\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/76/Applications-graphics.svg/120px-Applications-graphics.svg.png?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"48\" data-file-height=\"48\"></a></span></div>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:100%\">This  is a <i><b><span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Image_editing\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"en:Image editing\"><span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">retouched picture</span></a></span></b></i>, which means that it has been digitally altered from its original version. Modifications: <i>Color, ad small correction, add Sinus</i>. The\u00a0original can be viewed here: <b><a href=\"//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Head_anatomy_anterior_lateral_views.svg\" title=\"File:Head anatomy anterior lateral views.svg\">Head anatomy anterior lateral views.svg</a>:\u00a0<span class=\"mw-image-border\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Head_anatomy_anterior_lateral_views.svg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/36/Head_anatomy_anterior_lateral_views.svg/40px-Head_anatomy_anterior_lateral_views.svg.png?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"24\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/36/Head_anatomy_anterior_lateral_views.svg/60px-Head_anatomy_anterior_lateral_views.svg.png?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"647\" data-file-height=\"368\"></a></span></b>. Modifica